akh rounding over director narrative; bank deposit availability unresolved.\"","\".148\"","\"1.901\"","\"FY22\"","\"FY23\"","\"FY24\"","\"cfo_before_finance\"","\"cash_including_deposits\"","\"16.3991\"","\".4556\"","\"-.4279\"","\"1.4406\"","\".6502\"","\"3.1221\"","\"pat_after_preference\"","\"36.5125\"","\"4.1327\"","\"-1.0733\"","\"1.4029\"","\"1.5830\"","\"12.2198\"","\"FY19\"","\"FY20\"","\"4.5073996\"","\".1609359\"","\"S20 comparative; S19 appended opinion is FY18 not FY19.\"","\"9.4209241\"","\".8150063\"","\"S20 audited; S21 comparative consistent.\"","\"cash_excluding_deposits\"","\".3243699\"","\".1678552\"","\"16.3991111\"","\".5759394\"","\"2.8765051\"","\"2.0144805\"","\"-.2257504\"","\".1070512\"","\"10.0232372\"","\"Original S23 differs materially from S24 prior comparative reclassifications. Not used as identical accounting perimeter.\"","\"other_income_removed\"","\"tax_rate\"","\"incremental_DA_stress\"","\"explanation\"","\".15\"","\"Normalized PAT=(PBT-other income)*.75; no claim this is exact cash tax; second sensitivity subtracts additional .15cr pretax DA to test useful-life estimate. No quantified official estimate benefit.\"","\"H1FY25\"","\"H2FY25\"","\"H1FY26\"","\"H2FY26\"","\"source\"","\"19.62\"","\"32.51\"","\"28.82\"","\"24.41\"","\"SDECK rounded company presentation\"","\"FY25\"","\"FY26\"","\"domestic\"","\"exports\"","\"unbilled_change\"","\"47.066\"","\"4.392\"","\".667\"","\"42.611\"","\"10.203\"","\".419\"","\"authorized_shares\"","\"audited_anchor\"","\"entry\"","\"horizon_years\"","\"tax\"","\"loan_interest\"","\"deposit_interest\"","\"cash_floor\"","\"da_rate\"","\"maintenance_factor\"","\"starting\"","\"preentry\"","\"funding\"","\"primary_discount\"","\"terminal_growth\"","\"discount_rates\"","\"terminal_growths\"","\"scenarios\"","\"interpretation\"","10172000","\"2026-03-31\"","\".11\"","\".04\"","\".07\"","\"1.2\"","\"sales\"","\"deposits\"","\"other_net\"","\"payables\"","\"6.876\"","\"4.843\"","\"ends\"","\"days\"","\"old_tax_payment\"","\"tax_payment_period\"","\"growth_capex\"","\"front_received_fraction\"","\"bridge_is_unobserved\"","\"deposit_release_earliest\"","\"2026-04-30\"","\"2026-05-31\"","\"2026-06-30\"","\"2026-07-31\"","\"2026-08-31\"","\"2026-09-30\"","29","31","30","\"1.25\"","\".5\"","\"mode\"","\"post_entry_issue_price\"","\"fee\"","\"gross_limit\"","\"new_share_limit\"","\"loan_increase\"","\"rationale\"","\"optional uncommitted counterfactual only\"","\"288.8\"","\".02\"","\"15\"","1000000","\"0\"","\"Post-entry issue at a 20% discount to 361 rupees, 2% fees, 15 crore gross cap, one-million new-share cap and authorized share ceiling. No pre-entry equity because observed October shares are unchanged. No new finance is committed. Just-in-time issue completion is deliberately optimistic.\"","\".14\"","\".03\"","\".12\"","\".16\"","\"bear\"","\"base\"","\"bull\"","\"growth\"","\"pre_growth\"","\"margin\"","\"ar_days\"","\"inventory_days\"","\"purchase_ratio\"","\"payable_days\"","\"other_net_ratio\"","\"fixed_ratio\"","\"deposit_release\"","\"debt_due_month\"","\"ar_loss\"","\"inventory_loss\"","\"guarantee_call\"","\"190\"","\"280\"","\".76\"","\".22\"","\"2.4832\"","\"2.6675\"","\".146\"","\".18\"","\"170\"","\"240\"","\".72\"","\"25\"","\".09\"","\".20\"","\".21\"","\"140\"","\".69\"","\"35\"","\"All future paths, including the March-to-October bridge, are analyst scenarios rather than observed cash movements. Deposit availability, bank renewal, new issuance, collections and margins are not certified. Existing debt principal is repaid on the specified month; perpetual free refinancing is not assumed. Interest is 11%. Other net operating working capital excludes tax assets and security deposits, with operating security shown separately.\"","\"source_type\"","\"cutoff\"","\"quote_date\"","\"tape\"","\"master\"","\"security_fields\"","\"calendar_source\"","\"limitations\"","\"authored issuer-only transcription from 60 complete official NSE archives; CRC and inte